    "titleText": {
      "es": "Ustedes me toman por loco. Pero los locos no saben nada. ¿Podría un loco haber burlado a los mejores artistas de electrónica/techno de nuestra era? Lo próximo en caer será el grupo de house/trance de Roderick Usher.",
      "en": "You fancy me mad. Could a madman have outsmarted the greatest electronica/techno artists of our era? Next to fall will be Roderick Usher's house/trance band.",
      "noteEn": "The Spanish archive preserves this translated raster under an erroneous original link to xkcd #739 and a 2010-05-12 manifest date; its filename, panel art, dialogue, and title text correspond to official xkcd #740, The Tell-Tale Beat, dated 2010-05-14. The Spanish title text adds ‘Pero los locos no saben nada.’ to the Poe quotation; the English text here preserves the official #740 title attribute exactly."
    },
